{"id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-ce-set.md","title":"Recursively Enumerable Set","display":"df-ce-set — Recursively Enumerable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-ce-set","aliases":["92-df-ce-set"],"display":"df-ce-set — Recursively Enumerable Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-ce-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-ce-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ce-set — Recursively Enumerable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (definition target computably-enumerable predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (total-recursive function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> (standard range operator)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow A=\\emptyset\\lor\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\land A=\\operatorname{ran}(f))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow A=\\emptyset\\lor\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\land A=\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>是递归可枚举集（r.e.集）</li>\n<li>r.e.集是某个递归函数的值域（或空集）</li>\n<li>存在算法能枚举<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>的成员</li>\n<li>可判定集是r.e.集，反之不一定</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>可判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N} \\setminus A\">\\(\\mathbb{N} \\setminus A\\)</span>都是r.e.</li>\n<li>在固定标准编码下，c.e. 集在自然数标准模型中可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1\\)</span> 公式定义；转成系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 内的表示结论还需相应的算术可表示性定理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total-recursive function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow A=\\emptyset\\lor\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\land A=\\operatorname{ran}(f))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N} \\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_1","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1197,"backlinks":[{"id":"c9d6396579de4ff0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"916e46a7ff7a4753","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computable-enumerability predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"214ddac8d92e582e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computable-enumerability predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"c973cbf3deff3126","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"f0173be2f9b9b066","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"828452ef97907ed6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably enumerable predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"f2940633bae35b52","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"f80a790e5ccd9d21","anchor":"ref-8","loc